{"schema_version":1,"batch_id":"screening-0081","screening_model":"gpt-5.6-luna","reasoning":"medium","prompt_version":"gauss-screening-v1","item_count":6,"subject":"math","topic_key":"probability","total_weight":111,"expected_output":"screening-0081.output.jsonl","items":[{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1829","source_sha256":"3ff2ae4ea669155ff4471aee53a5dffe015c6b83fda316cfb9fa28c2a0f33de5","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"یک عدد ۲رقمی به تصادف انتخاب می‌کنیم، به کدام احتمال زوج است ولی بر ۶ بخش‌پذیر نیست؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1829/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال 1829","aspect_ratio":0.042}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{1}{2}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1829/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.6556}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{1}{3}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1829/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.5858}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{1}{4}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1829/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.6346}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{1}{6}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1829/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.5928}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"روش اول: مجموعهٔ اعداد دورقمی که بر ۲ بخش‌پذیر هستند را با $A$ و مجموعهٔ اعداد دورقمی که بر ۶ بخش‌پذیرند را با $B$ نمایش می‌دهیم.\n$n(A \\cap B') = n(A - B) = n(A) - n(A \\cap B) = n(A) - n(B)$\n$= ([\\dfrac{۹۹}{۲}] - [\\dfrac{۹}{۲}]) - ([\\dfrac{۹۹}{۶}] - [\\dfrac{۹}{۶}]) = (۴۹ - ۴) - (۱۶ - ۱) = ۳۰$\nبنابراین:\n$P(A \\cap B') = \\dfrac{۳۰}{۹۰} = \\dfrac{۱}{۳}$\nروش دوم: اگر از عدد ۱۰ آغاز کنیم از هر سه عدد متوالی یک عدد وجود دارد که بر ۲ بخش‌پذیر است ولی بر ۶ بخش‌پذیر نیست.\n$\\underline{۱۰}, ۱۱, \\underline{۱۲}, ۱۳, \\underline{۱۴}, ۱۵, \\underline{۱۶}, ۱۷, \\underline{۱۸}, \\dots, \\underline{۹۷}, \\underline{۹۸}, \\underline{۹۹}$\nبنابراین احتمال مورد نظر $\\dfrac{۱}{۳}$ است."},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1829/solution_6.webp","alt":"راه حل سوال ۱۸۲۹","aspect_ratio":0.6845}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1829/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1829/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1829/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1829/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1829/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1829/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1829/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"fa97bdae53df9c87fa2551af23146229e4eec8e4e1018394f69c9c355df930bd","bytes":1528},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1829/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"37abdee2c8d10b9c72c2636b5dfebcb9f4141503d4f8dfd8a18e69c1a839b0ce","bytes":1742},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1829/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"03b9fe17f01de0561dec23caa7202baf30ff9534382e95a6afd9cd9e2f494f72","bytes":984},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1829/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"521adf3523f780e7ff7f138ec9afe52b03e0c4f0f20feb83091b98dacb5f7a65","bytes":824},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1829/solution_6.webp","sha256":"87d9923b46f024b38c130dececb861b0560202dd8d934b82e441e70731cd6050","bytes":262942},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1829/stem_1.webp","sha256":"06b3b7cdc4d161a7b41c7dc1bd3fabc75c43b6f905bba00862b9759c954faecf","bytes":5574}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1829,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":10,"solution_page":169,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1830","source_sha256":"b717eb20e75c7f001f07e7ec86936b6fbd04f8a59d5636b3b8b5eebb0b9b9192","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"از بین اعداد مجموعهٔ $\\{1, 2, \\dots, 150\\}$ یک عدد به تصادف انتخاب می‌کنیم. با کدام احتمال این عدد بر ۲ یا ۳ بخش‌پذیر است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1830/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال 1830","aspect_ratio":0.0383}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{1}{2}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1830/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.6821}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{2}{3}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1830/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.6095}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{3}{4}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1830/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.6603}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{5}{6}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1830/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.6168}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"روش اول: پیشامد آن‌که عدد بر ۲ بخش‌پذیر باشد را $A$ و پیشامد آن‌که بر ۳ بخش‌پذیر باشد را $B$ می‌نامیم. بدیهی است $A \\cap B$ پیشامد آن است که عدد بر ۶ بخش‌پذیر باشد.\n$P(A \\cup B) = P(A) + P(B) - P(A \\cap B)$\n$= \\dfrac{[\\dfrac{۱۵۰}{۲}]}{۱۵۰} + \\dfrac{[\\dfrac{۱۵۰}{۳}]}{۱۵۰} - \\dfrac{[\\dfrac{۱۵۰}{۶}]}{۱۵۰} = \\dfrac{۷۵ + ۵۰ - ۲۵}{۱۵۰} = \\dfrac{۱۰۰}{۱۵۰} = \\dfrac{۲}{۳}$\nروش دوم: با شروع از عدد ۱ در هر ۶ عدد متوالی ۲ عدد نه بر ۲ بخش‌پذیر هستند و نه بر ۳؛ یعنی ۴ عدد یا بر ۲ بخش‌پذیر هستند یا بر ۳.\n$P = \\dfrac{۴}{۶} = \\dfrac{۲}{۳}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1830/solution_6.webp","alt":"راه حل سوال ۱۸۳۰","aspect_ratio":1.534}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1830/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1830/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1830/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1830/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1830/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1830/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1830/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"881613312ebb6498c25f3f5b3e5d2cfe731761c7a5c989419d6aad7ed38adc9d","bytes":1798},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1830/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"bdf932707c5c1b9adb457db17b24fe34d41888952247edf938be8b816522e31e","bytes":1730},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1830/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"3dbc3861f1a2b10ad8376f22c9bac7dd3529f1074889d007a931b655e41b41ec","bytes":826},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1830/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"4d2baadf02aff96d9fdfe8574f2088ac15895c8e449403da83fc491d43d8d27e","bytes":906},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1830/solution_6.webp","sha256":"18c5dcf38ca179d067a764149d5b3b656b099d82ca80de2a0af99416687aa6e0","bytes":34544},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1830/stem_1.webp","sha256":"53a1f5996ebedec00a85dacc368f9b98d923b70cb0eb5a1682570d70dbebd8ee","bytes":7966}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1830,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":10,"solution_page":169,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1831","source_sha256":"f581afc6c60e31b92b1579bccfdae7440b94450ef88a4aa3ec912d68ec6bdb9d","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"از بین اعداد طبیعی ۱ تا ۵۰ یک عدد به تصادف انتخاب می‌کنیم. با کدام احتمال این عدد نه زوج است و نه مضرب ۳؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1831/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال 1831","aspect_ratio":0.0387}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$0/32$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1831/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.4793}],[{"type":"text","text":"$0/33$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1831/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.4355}],[{"type":"text","text":"$0/34$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1831/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.4332}],[{"type":"text","text":"$0/35$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1831/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.4175}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"پیشامد زوج‌بودن را $A$ و پیشامد مضرب ۳ بودن را $B$ می‌نامیم.\n$n(A) = [\\dfrac{۵۰}{۲}] = ۲۵$\n$n(B) = [\\dfrac{۵۰}{۳}] = ۱۶$\n$n(A \\cap B) = [\\dfrac{۵۰}{۶}] = ۸$\nخواهیم داشت:\n$P(A' \\cap B') = P(A \\cup B)' = ۱ - P(A \\cup B) = ۱ - \\dfrac{n(A \\cup B)}{n(S)}$\n$= ۱ - \\dfrac{n(A) + n(B) - n(A \\cap B)}{n(S)} = ۱ - \\dfrac{۲۵ + ۱۶ - ۸}{۵۰}$\n$= ۱ - \\dfrac{۳۳}{۵۰} = \\dfrac{۱۷}{۵۰} = ۰/۳۴$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1831/solution_6.webp","alt":"راه حل سوال ۱۸۳۱","aspect_ratio":1.3278}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1831/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1831/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1831/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1831/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1831/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1831/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1831/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"424ad644c6a3942e14170c06ae54c0e773b8036ebf1c4e3c739fb2cb0da2bc94","bytes":1344},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1831/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"f2e3c93938535e151b6fda9b41f05406e583a2958618028421844a7c776651d2","bytes":1838},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1831/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"76c612b2d4131b7868de6415879ed416f49ad60c51c64fc8ee5089bf140dc10b","bytes":1334},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1831/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"8f802be069b7c948452a65ae7407956ca159e6f8cbe5e2ea7e95dddc67bb11d1","bytes":1248},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1831/solution_6.webp","sha256":"ccd49202848b4877d2cbbf68d72eb96d3794aea00f4758b3db87bc18138c82e8","bytes":24598},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1831/stem_1.webp","sha256":"044654c6a253337de1d17d5270107c635459e9a96b1fd025f3bdb7c7c991d5fa","bytes":6698}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1831,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":10,"solution_page":169,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1832","source_sha256":"9381401d94872195f332b5803887c7dbdd7296161874e7a7424951e182a49a9c","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"از بین اعداد سه‌رقمی یک عدد به تصادف انتخاب می‌کنیم. با کدام احتمال این عدد شامل رقم ۴ است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1832/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال 1832","aspect_ratio":0.0423}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$0/28$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1832/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.4675}],[{"type":"text","text":"$0/36$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1832/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.4247}],[{"type":"text","text":"$0/64$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1832/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.4225}],[{"type":"text","text":"$0/72$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1832/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.4072}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"پیشامد مورد نظر را $A$ می‌نامیم. از روش متمم استفاده می‌کنیم.\n$P(A) = \\dfrac{n(A)}{n(S)} = \\dfrac{n(S) - n(A')}{n(S)} = ۱ - \\dfrac{n(A')}{n(S)} = ۱ - P(A')$\n$= ۱ - \\dfrac{۸ \\times ۹ \\times ۹}{۹ \\times ۱۰ \\times ۱۰} = ۱ - \\dfrac{۷۲}{۱۰۰} = \\dfrac{۲۸}{۱۰۰} = ۰/۲۸$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1832/solution_6.webp","alt":"راه حل سوال ۱۸۳۲","aspect_ratio":2.7946}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1832/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1832/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1832/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1832/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1832/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1832/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1832/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"a61573ed80d841c1329a16de768baf5fa74d6f4a67b8f61487719066413241b9","bytes":1826},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1832/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"45f2639d27a0adb1af303686814faf1defa2777b7cf38442b571f5ff8c60772c","bytes":2292},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1832/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"86756795c0e896d716b8181b05541f578b3c400dfe80cc3533434f0b44685934","bytes":1894},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1832/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"4cb14fa92a907b492ae8a690e92b2e13e003e7fd9a34936ed5be82f3eefc3e8d","bytes":2340},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1832/solution_6.webp","sha256":"e225145f43a1de862eb2b4ea57bcdb09e3231f9b6c71831f68a8b7ba83d251b0","bytes":16702},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1832/stem_1.webp","sha256":"1598d5a890a04e9b6148aaaed30bfe190733c78dd1f15de3f9e27f0bbf2f0f8f","bytes":10810}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1832,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":10,"solution_page":169,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1833","source_sha256":"0cdaedc58c8b90ee2945350372c2cbc349d1dd813dc0a37abc316f1193a3a82b","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"دو عدد از بین اعداد $1, 2, \\dots, 10$ انتخاب می‌کنیم. با چه احتمالی این دو عدد متوالی‌اند؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1833/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال 1833","aspect_ratio":0.0524}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{1}{10}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1833/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.5858}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{1}{5}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1833/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.5858}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{2}{5}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1833/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.6346}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{4}{5}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1833/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.5928}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"تعداد اعضای فضای نمونه‌ای برابر $\\binom{۱۰}{۲}$ است. تعداد اعضای پیشامد مورد نظر برابر ۹ است:\n$A = \\{(۱, ۲), (۲, ۳), (۳, ۴), \\dots, (۹, ۱۰)\\}$\nبنابراین:\n$P(A) = \\dfrac{۹}{\\binom{۱۰}{۲}} = \\dfrac{۹}{۴۵} = \\dfrac{۱}{۵}$\nدقت داشته باشید که در فضای نمونه‌ای و پیشامد مورد نظر جایگشت دو عدد انتخابی اهمیت ندارد."},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1833/solution_6.webp","alt":"راه حل سوال ۱۸۳۳","aspect_ratio":2.0028}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1833/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1833/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1833/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1833/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1833/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1833/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1833/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"ede5fb9470a026